\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"character_id\",\"recommended_alias_name\",\"reason\"],\"properties\":{\"character_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60},\"recommended_alias_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":50},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":120}}}}}}},\"scene_level_usage_plan\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"maxItems\":10,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"scene_name\",\"expected_alias_usage\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":80},\"expected_alias_usage\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":6,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"character_id\",\"alias_name\",\"reason\"],\"properties\":{\"character_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60},\"alias_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":50},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":120}}}}}}},\"special_naming_rules\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":5,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":120}}}}}}", "debugLabel": "", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "systemPrompt", "label": "common:core.ai.Prompt", "valueType": "string", "isRichText": true, "placeholder": "common:core.app.tip.chatNodeSystemPromptTip", "maxLength": 100000, "renderTypeList": [ "textarea", "reference" ], "value": "你是“服装版本映射修订编剧”。\n\n根据审核结果修订当前服装映射，输出新的完整 appearance_mapping JSON，不要输出补丁说明。\n\n输入：\n【世界观JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.yuozoGpo$}}\n【故事大纲】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.ayxWwSpE$}}\n【分集计划】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.pxtQY7p2$}}\n【当前最终人设JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.fFM0mroW$}}\n【当前最终场景JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.iJudZHhM$}}\n【人物小传】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.yYYOuumm$}}\n【命名偏好】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.m3UxJ8pD$}}\n\n【服装映射审核结果JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.a9TqR7wL$}}\n【当前服装映射JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.h2KpLm91$}}\n\n修订要求：\n- 优先修 blocking_issues，不做无关重写。\n- 如果当前服装映射为空、是字面量变量名、自然语言说明、scene_setting 或“核心场景：”文本，则基于人设/场景/分集计划重新生成完整 appearance_mapping。\n- 修订后仍必须输出完整 JSON，顶层只能是 appearance_mapping。\n- appearance_mapping.characters 必须是数组，禁止写成“角色名 -> 对象”的字典。\n- 每个角色必须有 character_id、canonical_name、story_role、same_person_anchor、default_name、forbidden_generic_names、outfit_variants。\n- 每个 outfit_variants[] 必须有 variant_id、alias_name、applicable_identity_state、outfit_type、outfit_description、visual_keypoints、episode_range_hint、scene_trigger_rules、usage_rule、must_use_when_triggered、fallback_allowed、same_person_confirmation。\n- scene_trigger_rules 必须是 object，且包含 scene_names、scene_types、environment_or_time、status_conditions。\n- episode_level_usage_plan、scene_level_usage_plan、special_naming_rules 必须存在。\n- default_name 绝对不能为空；无法判断时直接使用 canonical_name。\n- alias_name 必须统一为“角色中文全名(场景/状态/身份)”。\n- 普通配角 1 个版本即可；重要角色 2-3 个版本，只有强剧情理由才到 4 个。\n- 禁止输出“核心场景：”文本、scene_setting、自然语言说明、审核结果或补丁说明。\n\n输出结构必须与生成节点完全一致。", "debugLabel": "", "description": "common:core.app.tip.systemPromptTip", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "history", "label": "common:core.module.input.label.chat history", "valueType": "chatHistory", "required": true, "max": 50, "min": 0, "renderTypeList": [ "numberInput", "reference" ], "value": 0, "debugLabel": "", "description": "workflow:max_dialog_rounds", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "quoteQA", "label": "", "valueType": "datasetQuote", "renderTypeList": [ "settingDatasetQuotePrompt" ], "debugLabel": "知识库引用", "description": "", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "fileUrlList", "label": "app:workflow.user_file_input", "valueType": "arrayString", "renderTypeList": [ "reference", "input" ], "value": [ [ "448745", "userFiles" ] ], "debugLabel": "文件链接", "description": "app:workflow.user_file_input_desc", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "userChatInput", "label": "workflow:user_question", "valueType": "string", "required": true, "selectedTypeIndex": 1, "renderTypeList": [ "reference", "textarea" ], "value": "按照提示词完成服装版本映射修订任务即可。", "debugLabel": "", "toolDescription": "用户问题" } ], "outputs": [ { "id": "history", "key": "histo